      "filename": "Impala Black Granite (gabbronorite) Bushveld Complex.jpg",
      "title": "File:Impala Black Granite (gabbronorite) Bushveld Complex.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/Impala_Black_Granite_%28gabbronorite%29_Bushveld_Complex.jpg",
